<title>USA: US spot MTBE lifted this week by NYMEX gasoline.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE lifted this week by NYMEX gasoline.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>cts/gallon  Prompt(Apr)     Any (May)	04/03/97(Ppt Apr)</p>
<p>Houston     74.25/75.00	76.00/77.00 N   74.00/74.50</p>
<p>New York    78.50/79.00	78.00/78.50 N   78.00/78.50</p>
<p>Spot MTBE prices got a boost this week from early strength in NYMEX gasoline futures and a tick up in activity, players said Thursday.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, Canada's Senate late Wednesday passed a bill that would effectively ban the controversial gasoline additive MMT, which could lead to a step up in demand for MTBE.</p>
<p>MMT has been used as a replacement for lead as an octane booster.</p>
